Objective 1: IP / Host Discovery
Command:   ping -c 4 192.168.1.10
           nmap -sn 192.168.1.10

Objective 2: TCP Scan
Command:  nmap -sT 192.168.1.10

Objective 3: UDP Scan
Command:  sudo nmap -sU 192.168.1.10

Objective 4: FIN Scan
Command:  sudo nmap -sF 192.168.1.10

Objective 5: NULL Scan
Command:  sudo nmap -sN 192.168.1.10

Objective 6: XMAS Scan
Command:  sudo nmap -sX 192.168.1.10

Objective 7: FTP Service Scan
Command:  nmap -p 21 192.168.1.10
          nmap -sV -p 21 192.168.1.10
